{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9d4990fa-254f-80f1-a928-2d3be7008a2b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T11:34:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:28:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Kevin. My name is Diane DeLuca. I'm calling about the plowing on my street. Let me explain what happened, if you have a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:28:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. I'll jot it down as you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So we had just a dusting of snow overnight, nothing much, but it's been bitter cold, so everything is frozen solid. This morning around seven, a city plow came down my street. When I went out about nine, my car was plowed in. There's a hard ridge of packed snow and ice all along the front and side of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:29:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the plow came through and left a berm against your car. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 70 Van Zandt Avenue, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Van Sant Avenue, got it. Let me write that down. Seventy Van Sant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's Van Zandt. Z-A-N-D-T. Van Zandt Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:30:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, Z-A-N-D-T. Sorry about that. Seventy Van Zandt Avenue, North End. Thanks for spelling it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. People get it wrong all the time, so don't worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So is the car parked on the street, or is it in a driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the street, in front of the house. I park at the curb on the right side as you're heading toward the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:30:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And how big is the pile? Is it a lot of snow, or more of a packed ridge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's mostly a packed ridge. Since the snow was so light, most of what the plow pushed was old stuff from the last storm, frozen hard. It's about knee high, and it runs the whole length of the car on the street side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that stuff turns into concrete in this cold. Have you tried to dig it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:31:14-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I went out with my shovel and chipped at it for a bit, but the ice is too thick for me. I'm in my seventies, and I don't want to hurt my back over it. What I'd like is for a plow to come back and clear it, or at least open up a path so I can get the car out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:31:44-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request for the plow to return to Van Zandt and clear that spot. I can't tell you exactly what time they'll get there, because the crews work through a list, but I'll flag that you're blocked in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Do you have any idea if it would be today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:32:12-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd hope so, since it's only a dusting and they're not buried in calls. But I'll be honest, I can't promise a time. If it's not done by this evening, give us a call back and we'll see where it stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I don't need to go anywhere this minute, so today or tomorrow morning would be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me read this back. Seventy Van Zandt Avenue, North End. City plow cleared the street this morning and left a packed ridge of snow and ice against a parked car at the curb. Resident requests a plow return to clear it. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's exactly it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what's a good callback number, in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-six-four. Perfect. Anything else I should put in the note? Like which side of the street, or a car color?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The car is a gray sedan, on the right side of the street as you're heading toward the water. That's the side where the snow is piled up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gray sedan, right side heading toward the water. Got it. That'll help the driver."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I appreciate it, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Ms. DeLuca. Stay warm out there, and call back if nobody's come by this evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:34:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
